  "description": "The Nomad version of the Weekender is made to travel. While it can easily handle being a weekday commuter on rough city roads, it really shines when you take it for a long haul.\n\nThe Nomad’s 100% 4130 chromoly frame and fork will welcome virtually anything that you can throw at it. This is our top of the line Weekender, and it comes equipped with an amazing parts build, like a SRtaAM Apex 1x derailleur and shifter, Avid disc brakes, SRAM Apex 1 cranks, Maxxis semi-knobby tires, and 700c wheels* for M-XL sizes.\n\n*Please note that the X-Small and Small Weekenders use 27.5 x 1.65\" Maxxis blackwall tires and these frame sizes are not compatible with 700c wheels.",
